-- causes ... code-loop orchestration"). qnfo-code-orchestrator leased a claimed task for 90 s while a step's model call could run
-- longer; a second lane then claimed the same row, and both wrote it unconditionally. Measured in code_tasks and cloud_ops_events:
-- ct_zogt4y5sdzauqw was made ready_to_publish at 06:26:44Z, a stale lane saved step verify with a ctx that carried no patch, and
-- code-task-publish failed it at 06:27:31Z with "task has no patch in ctx.patch" (6 rows in 48 h); ct_im100041 was handed off to
-- agent_issues twice (06:24:30Z and 06:25:01Z). qnfo-code-orchestrator 0.18.23 fences every save of a step on the lease the lane
-- holds (lease-fence.test.mjs). This file records the failure mode and its detector: no task failed at publish for a missing patch
-- in the last 60 minutes.
